&lt;p&gt;没什么东西，看一下 FTP：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://Sp1ke-sec.github.io/p/14.-cap/assets/image-20261108111935992.png&#34;
	width=&#34;1781&#34;
	height=&#34;418&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://Sp1ke-sec.github.io/p/14.-cap/assets/image-20261108111935992_hu5683193257664040.png 480w, https://Sp1ke-sec.github.io/p/14.-cap/assets/image-20261108111935992_hu18374365474192080997.png 1024w&#34;
